Produces a watertight mesh from the slices [.stl]
The mesh is assembled from the slice contours. This
is useful to export the mesh to an external 3D
printing software that requires a closed mesh. 
This process is somewhat slow and not guaranteed 
to succeed, so prefer ribbons whenever possible.ÔªøDiscretization step in xy (mm)
