G1 E-5 F300 ; retract the filament a bit before lifting the nozzle
G1 Z+0.5 E-5 F3600 ; move Z up a bit and retract filament even more
G28 X0 Y0 ; Home X and Y
M84 ; steppers off
G90 ; absolute positioning
